This file is retired (2026-08-05).

It used to be re-rendered every 6 minutes by pushing to a git branch.
Nothing updates it any more, so it would only tell you about weather
that has already happened. The live service is:

    curl echorune.net/bangkok/en

That endpoint takes any place name or any coordinate on earth, in en or
zh, and is not limited to the eight cities that lived here.

    curl echorune.net/help
